# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day23

## Topic
# 가정법
### If + 과거 / If + had p.p.

---

## 1. 현재 사실과 반대되는 가정

### Structure

If + 주어 + 과거동사,  
주어 + would + 동사원형

### Examples

- If I had more time, I would travel more.
- If I were you, I would accept the offer.
- If she lived closer, she would visit us more often.

### Meaning

현재 사실과 반대되는 상황을 가정한다.

---

## 2. 과거 사실과 반대되는 가정

### Structure

If + 주어 + had + p.p.,  
주어 + would have + p.p.

### Examples

- If I had studied harder, I would have passed the exam.
- If she had left earlier, she would have caught the train.
- If we had known about the problem, we would have fixed it earlier.

### Meaning

과거에 실제로 일어나지 않은 일을 가정한다.

---

## 3. 가장 중요한 구분

### 현재와 반대

If + 과거 → would + 동사원형

> If I had more time, I would study more.

현재 나는 시간이 많지 않음.

---

### 과거와 반대

If + had p.p. → would have p.p.

> If I had studied more, I would have passed.

과거에 더 공부하지 않았고, 합격하지 못함.

---

## TOEIC Tip

문제에서 **would have + p.p.**가 보이면

→ 과거 사실과 반대되는 가정법을 의심한다.

---

## Important

❌ If I would have studied harder...

✅ If I had studied harder...

가정법 if절에는 일반적으로 **would**를 쓰지 않는다.

---

## Quick Comparison

| 의미 | If절 | 결과절 |
|---|---|---|
| 현재 반대 | If + 과거 | would + V |
| 과거 반대 | If + had p.p. | would have p.p. |
